#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s: the node answered without the fixed read script framing. Its key may not be limited to a forced command running pfs-read.sh."
msgstr "%s: node ɗin ya amsa ba tare da tsarin rubutun karatu na ƙayyadadden tsari ba. Mai yiwuwa maɓallinsa bai iyakance ga umarnin tilas da ke gudanar da pfs-read.sh ba."

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s: the node host key is not in the known hosts file, or it changed. Check the key before adding it."
msgstr "%s: maɓallin host na node ba ya cikin fayil ɗin known hosts, ko kuma ya canza. Duba maɓallin kafin ƙara shi."

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s: the endpoint resolves outside the networks allowed for poller %d, so it is not read."
msgstr "%s: ƙarshen haɗin yana warwarewa a wajen hanyoyin sadarwa da aka yardar wa poller %d, don haka ba a karanta shi ba."

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s: the read script printed %d parameters the plugin does not read, so it is not the shipped pfs-read.sh. The node may be exposing more than the plugin needs."
msgstr "%s: rubutun karatu ya buga sigogi %d waɗanda plugin ɗin ba ya karantawa, don haka ba pfs-read.sh ɗin da aka aiko da shi ba ne. Mai yiwuwa node ɗin yana bayyana fiye da abin da plugin ɗin ke buƙata."

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s: %d target names in the node output did not match the expected pattern or filesystem and were ignored."
msgstr "%s: sunayen maƙasudai %d a cikin fitarwar node ba su yi daidai da tsarin da ake sa rani ko tsarin fayiloli ba kuma an yi watsi da su."

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "The reader on poller %d has not completed a run in the last %d seconds. Values from its nodes are getting stale."
msgstr "Mai karatu a kan poller %d bai kammala wani gudana ba a cikin daƙiƙoƙi %d na ƙarshe. Ƙimomi daga nodes ɗinsa suna tsufa."

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "Installing the Parallel Filesystem templates failed: %s"
msgstr "Shigar da samfuran Parallel Filesystem ya kasa: %s"

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
msgid "The Parallel Filesystem templates are not installed, so no device can be added."
msgstr "Ba a shigar da samfuran Parallel Filesystem ba, don haka ba za a iya ƙara kowace na'ura ba."

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "The data query file resource/script_server/%s is missing from Cacti or differs from the one this plugin ships, so the data queries cannot list targets."
msgstr "Fayil ɗin tambayar bayanai resource/script_server/%s ya ɓace daga Cacti ko ya bambanta da wanda wannan plugin ɗin ke zuwa da shi, don haka tambayoyin bayanai ba za su iya jera maƙasudai ba."

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "Filesystem %s is mapped to device %d, which no longer exists."
msgstr "An haɗa tsarin fayiloli %s zuwa na'ura %d, wadda ba ta wanzu yanzu."

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "The device of filesystem %s is polled by poller %d, but its nodes are read by poller %d, whose cache the device's data sources need."
msgstr "Na'urar tsarin fayiloli %s tana samun bincike daga poller %d, amma poller %d ne ke karanta nodes ɗinta, wanda tushen bayanan na'urar ke buƙatar ma'ajiyarsa ta wucin gadi."

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "The SSH key file %s does not exist on this server."
msgstr "Fayil ɗin maɓallin SSH %s ba ya wanzu a kan wannan sabar."

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "The SSH key file %s can be read or written by users other than its owner (mode %s). Limit it to the poller user."
msgstr "Wasu masu amfani ban da mamallakinsa na iya karanta ko rubuta fayil ɗin maɓallin SSH %s (yanayi %s). Iyakance shi ga mai amfani na poller."

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "The known hosts file %s does not exist on this server, so no node can be read from it."
msgstr "Fayil ɗin known hosts %s ba ya wanzu a kan wannan sabar, don haka ba za a iya karanta kowane node daga gare shi ba."

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "The SSH client %s does not exist on this server."
msgstr "Abokin ciniki na SSH %s ba ya wanzu a kan wannan sabar."

