#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "SSH Client"
msgstr "Abokin Ciniki na SSH"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path, on each poller that reads nodes, to the private key whose public half each node lists in authorized_keys with a forced command running pfs-read.sh. Readable only by the poller user. The plugin never creates, copies, or prints it."
msgstr "Cikakkiyar hanya, a kan kowane poller da ke karanta nodes, zuwa maɓallin sirri wanda kowane node ke jera rabin jama'arsa a cikin authorized_keys tare da umarnin tilas da ke gudanar da pfs-read.sh. Mai amfani na poller kaɗai ke iya karantawa. Plugin ɗin ba ya taɓa ƙirƙira, kwafa, ko buga shi."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "SSH Key File"
msgstr "Fayil ɗin Maɓallin SSH"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to the known_hosts file holding each node host key under the node endpoint name. A node whose key is missing or changed is not read."
msgstr "Cikakkiyar hanya zuwa fayil ɗin known_hosts da ke riƙe da maɓallin host na kowane node ƙarƙashin sunan ƙarshen haɗin node. Ba a karanta node ɗin da maɓallinsa ya ɓace ko ya canza ba."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Known Hosts File"
msgstr "Fayil ɗin Known Hosts"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Connect Timeout"
msgstr "Ƙarewar Lokacin Haɗi"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds to wait for a node to accept the connection."
msgstr "Daƙiƙoƙin da za a jira node ya karɓi haɗin."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Read Timeout"
msgstr "Ƙarewar Lokacin Karatu"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one node read may take in total before it is stopped and recorded as failed."
msgstr "Daƙiƙoƙin da karatun node ɗaya zai iya ɗauka gaba ɗaya kafin a tsayar da shi kuma a yi rajistarsa a matsayin ya kasa."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "KiB one node may return. A larger answer is discarded and recorded as failed."
msgstr "KiB da node ɗaya zai iya mayarwa. Ana watsi da amsa mafi girma kuma a yi rajistarta a matsayin ta kasa."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Maximum Response"
msgstr "Mafi Girman Amsa"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Reader"
msgstr "Mai Karatu"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Reader Time Budget"
msgstr "Kasafin Lokacin Mai Karatu"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one reader run may spend before it stops starting node reads. Keep it below the poller interval; unread nodes are read on the next run."
msgstr "Daƙiƙoƙin da gudana ɗaya ta mai karatu za ta iya kashewa kafin ta daina fara karatun nodes. Ajiye shi ƙasa da tazarar poller; ana karanta nodes ɗin da ba a karanta ba a gudana ta gaba."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Concurrent Reads"
msgstr "Karatun Lokaci Guda"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Node reads one reader runs at the same time."
msgstr "Karatun nodes da mai karatu ɗaya ke gudanarwa a lokaci guda."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Cirewa"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Keep Plugin Tables on Uninstall"
msgstr "Riƙe Teburan Plugin yayin Cirewa"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin keeps its filesystems, nodes, inventory, and cache. Clear it to have the uninstall drop them; export the registry first from the Parallel Filesystem Admin page. Storage nodes are never contacted either way."
msgstr "Idan an zaɓa, cire plugin ɗin zai riƙe tsarin fayilolinsa, nodes, ƙidayar kaya, da ma'ajiyar wucin gadi. Share shi don cirewar ta goge su; fitar da rajistar tukuna daga shafin Gudanarwar Parallel Filesystem. Ba a taɓa tuntuɓar nodes na ajiya ta kowace hanya ba."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Delete the Devices This Plugin Created on Uninstall"
msgstr "Goge Na'urorin da Wannan Plugin Ya Ƙirƙira Lokacin Cirewa"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin deletes the devices it created for filesystems, with their graphs and data sources, as deleting them in Cacti would. Existing devices that were mapped to a filesystem are never deleted. RRD files are removed only if Cacti's own RRD cleanup setting removes them. Cleared, the devices stay."
msgstr "Idan an zaɓa, cire plugin ɗin zai goge na'urorin da ya ƙirƙira don tsarin fayiloli, tare da zane-zanensu da tushen bayanai, kamar yadda goge su a Cacti zai yi. Na'urorin da ke akwai waɗanda aka haɗa zuwa tsarin fayiloli ba a taɓa goge su ba. Ana cire fayilolin RRD ne kaɗai idan saitin tsaftacewar RRD na Cacti da kansa ya cire su. Idan aka share, na'urorin za su tsaya."

