msgstr "Wannan rikodin na na'urar Cacti ne da ba ka da izini a kanta. Ba a canza komai ba."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "Name: another filesystem of this backend already uses this name."
msgstr "Suna: wani tsarin fayiloli na wannan backend ya riga ya yi amfani da wannan sunan."

