msgstr "An adana tsarin fayiloli."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The filesystem, its nodes, and its inventory were deleted. Its Cacti device, data sources, and graphs were kept. No node was contacted."
msgstr "An goge tsarin fayiloli, nodes ɗinsa, da ƙidayar kayansa. An riƙe na'urar Cacti ɗinsa, tushen bayanai, da zane-zanensa. Ba a tuntuɓi kowane node ba."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "Name: another node already uses this name."
msgstr "Suna: wani node ya riga ya yi amfani da wannan sunan."

#: pfs_admin.php
