msgstr "An adana node ɗin."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The node was deleted. Targets it reported keep their history."
msgstr "An goge node ɗin. Maƙasudan da ya ruwaito za su riƙe tarihinsu."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "Enter a network as an address and prefix length, such as 10.20.0.0/16."
msgstr "Shigar da hanyar sadarwa a matsayin adireshi da tsawon prefix, kamar 10.20.0.0/16."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "No device was added: the filesystem already has one, or the templates are not installed."
msgstr "Ba a ƙara kowace na'ura ba: tsarin fayiloli ya riga ya sami guda ɗaya, ko kuma ba a shigar da samfuran ba."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The device could not be mapped. It may be mapped to another filesystem."
msgstr "Ba a iya haɗa na'urar ba. Mai yiwuwa an haɗa ta zuwa wani tsarin fayiloli."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The device was mapped and the data queries and overview graphs were added."
msgstr "An haɗa na'urar kuma an ƙara tambayoyin bayanai da zane-zanen taƙaitawa."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "Cacti did not create the device. See the Cacti log."
msgstr "Cacti bai ƙirƙiri na'urar ba. Duba rajistar Cacti."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The device, its data queries, and its overview graphs were created."
msgstr "An ƙirƙiri na'urar, tambayoyin bayananta, da zane-zanen taƙaitawarta."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The device is no longer mapped. It and its graphs were kept; its data queries list no targets until it is mapped again."
msgstr "Ba a haɗa na'urar ba yanzu. An riƙe ta da zane-zanenta; tambayoyin bayananta ba sa jera maƙasudai har sai an sake haɗa ta."

